<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1536075331"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:30.725"><div begin="13.530" end="37.074"><p begin="13.530" end="18.260" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.530" end="13.894">躺于</span><span begin="13.894" end="14.094">瘠</span><span begin="14.094" end="14.598">土</span><span begin="14.598" end="14.949">一</span><span begin="14.949" end="15.130">片</span> <span begin="15.130" end="15.549">若你</span><span begin="15.549" end="15.767">没</span><span begin="15.767" end="16.184">法</span><span begin="16.184" end="16.566">入</span><span begin="16.566" end="16.756">眠</span> <span begin="16.756" end="17.073">踮起</span><span begin="17.073" end="17.274">脚</span><span begin="17.274" end="18.260">尖</span></p><p begin="20.013" end="24.509" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.013" end="20.532">舞摆里</span><span begin="20.532" end="21.350">兜兜</span><span begin="21.350" end="21.692">转</span> <span begin="21.692" end="22.209">转身去</span><span begin="22.209" end="22.574">找</span><span begin="22.574" end="23.008">光</span><span begin="23.008" end="23.204">线</span> <span begin="23.204" end="23.495">就快</span><span begin="23.495" end="23.797">望</span><span begin="23.797" end="24.509">见</span></p><p begin="25.671" end="32.073" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.671" end="26.401">路中有雾</span><span begin="26.401" end="27.453">一同</span><span begin="27.453" end="27.819">探</span><span begin="27.819" end="28.478">险</span> <span begin="29.210" end="29.620">沿途</span><span begin="29.620" end="30.720">遇到</span><span begin="30.720" end="31.022">麦</span><span begin="31.022" end="32.073">田</span></p><p begin="32.322" end="37.074" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.322" end="32.809">如累了</span> <span begin="32.809" end="33.174">坐低</span><span begin="33.174" end="33.378">半</span><span begin="33.378" end="34.394">天</span> <span begin="34.394" end="34.957">有歌唱</span><span begin="34.957" end="35.819">多</span><span begin="35.819" end="37.074">遍</span></p></div><div begin="37.644" end="1:03.512"><p begin="37.644" end="41.034" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.644" end="38.783">摇曳</span><span begin="38.783" end="39.285">里</span> <span begin="39.447" end="39.697">到</span><span begin="39.697" end="39.851">旷</span><span begin="39.851" end="40.213">野</span> <span begin="40.213" end="40.382">到</span><span begin="40.382" end="40.649">晚</span><span begin="40.649" end="41.034">空</span></p><p begin="41.144" end="44.515" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.144" end="41.444">要碰</span><span begin="41.444" end="41.728">到</span> <span begin="41.728" end="41.911">永</span><span begin="41.911" end="42.195">远</span><span begin="42.195" end="42.610">青</span><span begin="42.610" end="43.162">春</span><span begin="43.162" end="43.446">的</span><span begin="43.446" end="44.515">梦</span></p><p begin="45.895" end="52.395" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.895" end="46.234">会跌</span><span begin="46.234" end="46.550">痛</span> <span begin="46.550" end="46.919">也会</span><span begin="46.919" end="47.534">哭</span> <span begin="47.534" end="47.876">教会</span><span begin="47.876" end="48.175">我</span> <span begin="48.175" end="48.508">要记</span><span begin="48.508" end="49.227">得</span> <span begin="49.227" end="49.593">心</span><span begin="49.593" end="49.944">处</span><span begin="49.944" end="51.128">的</span><span begin="51.128" end="51.529">悸</span><span begin="51.529" end="52.395">动</span></p><p begin="52.851" end="58.232" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.851" end="53.409">随伤</span><span begin="53.409" end="53.926">疤</span> <span begin="53.926" end="54.561">渗入你</span> <span begin="54.561" end="55.162">栽种</span><span begin="55.162" end="56.297">一弯</span><span begin="56.297" end="56.695">笑</span><span begin="56.695" end="58.232">容</span></p><p begin="58.769" end="1:03.512" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.769" end="59.101">我会</span><span begin="59.101" end="59.417">与</span><span